  "body_html": "<p>Experience ultimate comfort and style with the Jeminise Comforter Set. Crafted from premium, finely brushed microfibers, this 5-piece bedding set offers exceptional softness, lightness, and breathability for a peaceful night's sleep. The stylish Ghost 1 pattern adds a touch of fashion and coziness to your sleeping space.</p><h3>Key Features</h3><ul>\n<li>\n<strong>Premium Material:</strong> Filled with finely brushed microfibers for exceptional softness, lightness, and breathability, ensuring maximum comfort.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Included Components:</strong> This 5-piece set comes with one comforter, one flat sheet, one fitted sheet, one pillowcase, and one pillow sham.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Exquisite Design:</strong> Features stylish Ghost 1 patterns and exquisite stitching that enhances durability and prevents filling from shifting.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Easy Fit:</strong> The deep-pocket fitted sheet has an elastic band on all four sides, accommodating mattresses up to 14 inches thick for a secure fit.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Easy Care:</strong> Simply machine wash in cold water and tumble dry on low for lasting durability without weakening or tearing.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Versatile Use:</strong> Suitable for all seasons – Fall, Summer, Winter.</li>\n</ul><h3>Product Specifications</h3><table><tbody>\n<tr>\n<th>Brand</th>\n<td>Jeminise</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Product Type</th>\n<td>Comforter Set</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Material</th>\n<td>Polyester</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Fabric Type</th>\n<td>Brushed Microfiber and Polyester Filling.</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Selected Design</th>\n<td>Ghost 1</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Theme</th>\n<td>Horror Cartoon</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Pattern</th>\n<td>Pumpkin,Ghost,Bats</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Selected Size</th>\n<td>Twin</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Included Components</th>\n<td>1 x Comforter &amp; 1 x Pillowcase &amp; 1 x Pillow Sham &amp; 1 x Fitted Sheet &amp; 1 x Flat Sheet</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Dimensions</th>\n<td>90 x 68 x 1 inches</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Special Feature</th>\n<td>Deep-pocket fitted sheet</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Seasons</th>\n<td>All, Fall, Summer, Winter</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Care Instructions</th>\n<td>Machine Wash</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>",
